        "addition": "## Windows Environment\nThis workspace runs on Windows. Always use PowerShell (not Git Bash) for environment variable changes, elevated commands, and path operations. Prefer forward slashes or raw strings for paths. Be aware of cp1252 encoding — use `encoding='utf-8'` explicitly in Python file operations.",
